  unitName: Serpent Legacy Hilda
  unitId: 820938
  unitNumber: 8629
  description: One of the Seven Demonlords of Nogreth, and leader of the "Chilling
    Beauties." Hilda is originally from Phillarm and her partner in crime is a large
    snake.Blaming the King for the death of her beloved father, she began following
    Elhaza, who fed her grudge against him. She coldly carried out any missions given
    to her as a member of the Nogreth forces, including trifling with a certain group
    of young knights. However, upon discovering the real cause of her father's death
    she was overcome by emotion, and following her younger sister's lead, chose to
    protect the knights against Melfel instead. She was then vanished to another
    world after sacrificing herself to save the others.
  summonDesc: I have nowhere to be, you know what I mean? No? <br>It means that I
    can keep you company whenever you like!
  fusionDesc: An older sister always protects her younger siblings. That's our job.
    <br>I'll protect you too, if you give me more power.
  evoDesc: For my dearest little sister, <br>I'll do whatever it takes.<br>You'll
    help me, won't you?
  element: 2
  rarity: 7
